WEBVTT

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:35.600
Well?

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:37.570
Have you learned your lesson?

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:40.820
Next time we won't let you off so easily.

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:47.680
Those girls...

00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:53.540
You...

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:55.190
Your hair...

00:01:59.690 --> 00:02:02.950
The good news is, it looks like we can cover it up.

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:05.960
But that doesn't make it okay.

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:08.250
I feel bad for you.

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:14.980
It'd probably be best if you didn't go out for a while.

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:15.940
It's dangerous.

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:20.500
I'll never forgive them.

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:24.050
I couldn't stop them today,

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:25.440
but I won't let them do it again.

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:28.710
No matter what happens,

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:30.590
I'll protect you.

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:32.660
Toma...

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:36.750
Sorry.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.120
I'll be right back,

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:51.750
so stay here and be good.

00:02:53.390 --> 00:02:54.150
Okay.

00:02:56.120 --> 00:02:58.840
Don't go out by yourself,

00:02:58.840 --> 00:02:59.520
okay?

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:00.490
Okay.

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:11.030
<i>Those girls...</i>

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:14.770
<i>They're Ikki's fans.</i>

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:17.570
<i>Why did they...</i>

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:21.080
<i>That's right...</i>

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:24.330
Give me the detailed report in the back alley again.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:27.630
<i>We're supposed to meet today.</i>

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:33.760
<i>Maybe if I ask Ikki, I'll find something out.</i>

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:41.180
Who could that be?

00:03:43.770 --> 00:03:44.770
<i>He's not picking up.</i>

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:48.780
<i>I can't make Toma worry any more.</i>

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:50.900
<i>I have to do something...</i>

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:56.010
You...

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:00.780
I told you to stay inside, didn't I?

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:03.780
What are you doing?

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:06.380
U-Um...

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:07.580
It's Ikki, right?

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:11.670
You have plans to meet him in the back alley.

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:13.930
Th-That's right.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:17.350
Enough.

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:19.430
Let's go back inside.

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:20.530
I...

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.580
If you go out walking by yourself like that,

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:29.080
do you think nothing's going to happen?

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:32.120
If you wanted to go out, you could've let me know.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.570
You couldn't do that either?

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:36.260
They might do more than just cut your hair.

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:38.560
You could really get hurt.

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:42.380
Why can't you listen to me?

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:45.080
Why do you still go out despite the risk?

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:50.210
There was something I wanted to ask Ikki.

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:51.960
What?

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:53.970
I'm sorry.

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:57.880
So in the end, no matter how hard I try to stop you,

00:04:57.880 --> 00:04:59.570
you're going to leave.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:03.920
No matter what I say, you'd rather be with...

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:05.690
Toma... Um...

00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:06.700
Don't.

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:10.870
I just need some time to calm down.

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:13.950
Don't talk to me until then.

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:22.490
Come here.

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:38.780
I don't want to see you cry.

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:43.300
I don't want to see you sad or see you suffer either.

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:47.720
I always want to see you smile,

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:49.080
and I want to make you smile.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:50.270
So,

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:52.310
to that end,

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:55.020
I don't mind if you hate me.

00:05:55.980 --> 00:05:57.170
That's what I decided.

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:02.790
But it hurts.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:07.250
The truth is, I want to look after you more than anyone.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:09.660
But I can't.

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:25.330
Good morning.

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:26.390
Here.

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:32.020
I'll be working on my report in my room today.

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:44.970
<i>Did I fall asleep?</i>

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:47.330
That was quite a long nap.

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:50.710
I was surprised you didn't wake up.

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:54.360
You looked so peaceful in your sleep.

00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:55.880
I couldn't bear to wake you.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:59.470
I did make a lot of progress on my report in the meantime.

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:02.170
I don't mind a sleeping beauty,

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:04.600
but it's almost dinner,

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:06.120
so you should get up.

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:15.230
Here, coffee.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:19.900
You were sound asleep last night around dinner,

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:23.800
but it's not good for you, so make sure you eat breakfast.

00:07:24.850 --> 00:07:25.530
Okay.

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:27.110
Here.

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:29.160
Thank you.

00:07:35.190 --> 00:07:36.090
Wake up!

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:39.030
Hey, you.

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:41.250
Wake up!

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:44.150
Orion?

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:46.300
Shh! Don't say anything.

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:48.060
Toma will hear you.

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:50.220
<i>Is something wrong?</i>

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:54.960
Listen, don't eat or drink anything Toma makes.

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:56.950
He's putting something in it.

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:57.650
What?

00:07:57.650 --> 00:08:02.050
Because of it, all you've done is sleep through the day.

00:08:02.050 --> 00:08:03.210
Toma must be trying to keep you from...

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:04.490
Good morning.

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:06.950
Although, the sun's already setting.

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:10.560
You've been sleeping a lot recently.

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:13.170
I'll make some dinner, so try to wake up.

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:18.480
Don't!

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:20.630
Don't drink that!

00:08:22.050 --> 00:08:23.340
What's the matter?

00:08:23.340 --> 00:08:26.710
Nothing. I'm just sleepy.

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:28.890
You don't have to force yourself.

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.060
My report is nearly done now,

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:34.070
so if you need anything, call me.

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:39.030
I told you, don't!

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:40.930
In here.

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:42.860
Dump it in here.

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.350
<i>What do you mean?</i>

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:48.370
Just listen.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.630
Pretend to be asleep for a while.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:06.490
Oh no, oh no!

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.960
That was close.

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:16.130
For dinner, make up an excuse, like you're not hungry,

00:09:16.130 --> 00:09:17.800
because you mustn't eat, okay?

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:19.900
Okay.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.070
Hey, you.

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:26.650
Look at Toma.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:31.380
He thinks you're sleeping, so he's let his guard down.

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:34.410
Let's get out of here while we can.

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:35.110
Huh?

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:37.070
Let's go back home.

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:38.580
B-But...

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.220
It's dangerous to stay here.

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:43.590
Don't you think Toma is acting weird?

00:09:57.850 --> 00:10:00.550
Isn't that your cell phone?

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:01.750
Yeah.

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:04.060
He said it was broken.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:09.130
It's not broken at all.

00:10:11.020 --> 00:10:13.370
<i>Your very existence is a nuisance.</i>

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:14.710
<i>Just disappear.</i>

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:16.770
<i>Bitch! Bitch! Bitch!</i>

00:10:16.770 --> 00:10:17.870
What is this?

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:20.330
<i>Break up! Break up! Break up!</i>

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:21.560
<i>I'll never forgive you!</i>

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:23.480
<i>6 PM today in front of Myoga Station.</i>

00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:24.650
<i>I'll help you kill some time.
Nice to meet you.</i>

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:27.740
<i>Your picture on the forum is really cute.</i>

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:30.090
What's with these scary texts?

00:10:30.090 --> 00:10:35.220
This means someone's been spreading around your phone number and picture, doesn't it?

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:38.060
<i>There's a text from Ikki.</i>

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:40.970
<i>How did August 1st go?</i>

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:42.690
<i>Did it go well?</i>

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:45.820
<i>August 1st?</i>

00:10:45.820 --> 00:10:48.780
<i>You don't seem well, so I'm worried.</i>

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:50.640
<i>I wanted to go see you,</i>

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:53.550
<i>but Rika stopped me because she said it was unfair.</i>

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:54.850
<i>Sorry.</i>

00:10:54.850 --> 00:10:56.480
<i>Rika?</i>

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:58.230
<i>Unfair?</i>

00:11:29.850 --> 00:11:31.920
Hey, wait!

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.590
I said, wait!

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:36.010
Shin!

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:39.820
Why are <i>you</i> here?

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:42.770
Don't come in without asking.

00:11:42.770 --> 00:11:45.420
What's going on?

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:47.470
It's complicated.

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:49.480
I've been keeping her safe at my place.

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:51.100
What do you mean, "keeping her safe"?

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:52.980
I haven't heard anything about it.

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:54.660
Are you sure you didn't force her against her will?

00:11:55.050 --> 00:11:56.860
It's to avoid danger.

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:58.540
She understands.

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:02.320
Even if something happened to her,

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:05.850
is it really necessary to keep her here for days in secret?

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:08.340
I wonder.

00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:14.500
Toma, are you sure you didn't want to just keep her here for yourself?

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:16.550
I'm not going to justify myself.

00:12:16.550 --> 00:12:20.140
But there's a reason why I've been silent.

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:23.240
I can't trust anyone with this.

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:25.940
That's right.

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:28.090
That's how you are.

00:12:28.090 --> 00:12:29.950
No matter what happens, you look out for yourself.

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:31.500
That's right.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:33.400
So would you mind not getting involved?

00:12:33.400 --> 00:12:35.330
Just leave her to me.

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.240
What?!

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:37.130
Why should I?

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:38.400
I told you.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:40.420
I don't trust anyone.

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:42.200
Not even you, Shin.

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:43.500
You asshole...

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:44.470
Toma!

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:45.000
Stop it!

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:50.240
Shin, let's talk outside.

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:52.580
Do you think I'll listen to you?

00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:55.550
In the same way that you don't trust me,

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:59.710
I can't trust you with her.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.470
For starters, who are you to her?

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:03.930
You're not even her boyfriend or anything.

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:07.690
Shin, let's go outside.

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:11.490
If you don't, I'll throw you out without explaining anything.

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:14.910
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:13:16.930 --> 00:13:20.570
<i>Toma isn't my boyfriend?</i>

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:27.340
Where's Shin?

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:29.580
He went home.

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:30.130
Huh?

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:34.060
I never expected him to interfere.

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:36.090
I thought this was going well, too.

00:13:38.270 --> 00:13:39.820
You overheard us, right?

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:43.100
When you look at me like that,

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:46.300
it does hurt a little.

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:49.180
That's right.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:53.730
Putting you in danger may have been all part of my own plan.

00:13:54.170 --> 00:13:58.610
That's how I cornered you and confined you to this room.

00:13:58.610 --> 00:14:00.930
Hey, are you scared of me?

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:21.090
Resistance is futile.

00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:23.000
Sorry.

00:14:23.640 --> 00:14:25.840
It may have all been too late.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:29.320
Or maybe I waited too long.

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:32.630
I only wanted to keep you from crying,

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:36.390
but I couldn't grant even that one wish.

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:40.770
Why am I...

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:51.880
Good morning.

00:14:54.980 --> 00:14:56.080
Did you sleep well?

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:57.540
Are you cold?

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:00.270
Toma...

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:05.710
Don't worry.

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:11.560
Hey, why are you doing this?

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:14.450
If I don't, you'll try to leave again, right?

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:18.070
Here's a change of clothes.

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:24.510
If you need anything else, just call.

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:27.370
I'm sorry.

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.370
I'm here by your side,

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:32.160
but I can't do anything,

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:34.920
even though he's doing terrible things to you.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:39.320
Why is Toma doing this?

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:41.770
He said it was to protect me.

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:43.710
By locking you up in here?

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:45.460
Not likely!

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:47.640
He lied and said you were going out...

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:51.450
I don't understand what Toma's up to at all!

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:58.060
It must be boring with nothing in here.

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:01.690
I went and got some things that you might like.

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:05.450
Although, I don't know what you're into now.

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:08.740
Are they a little too childish?

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:13.430
If you don't like them, you can just leave them like that.

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:18.210
When I look at you like this,

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:21.050
you look like an imprisoned princess.

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:25.310
But now I can protect you.

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:29.630
I don't believe this.

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:33.220
Is this Toma's love or guilt?

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:35.410
Probably both.

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:38.410
But this is like a toy box.

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:41.230
Does that make you one of his toys?

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:42.980
Me?

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:44.120
That's right.

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:46.810
You're like his favorite doll.

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:57.630
Sorry.

00:16:57.630 --> 00:16:58.460
Did I wake you?

00:16:59.650 --> 00:17:00.520
It's dinner.

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:04.430
If you want anything or want me to do anything,

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:05.980
just let me know.

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:09.140
Tell him you want out!

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:12.060
I want out of here.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:14.530
I'm sorry.

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:16.410
I can't...

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:18.730
do that.

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:23.690
What's wrong?

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:27.320
Can't you sleep?

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:32.540
This view

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:35.590
is quite shocking.

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:40.810
Like, what am I doing?

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:45.490
Why do you always sleep on the floor?

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:50.290
You're basically sleeping on the floor,

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:53.060
so how could I sleep in a bed?

00:17:57.870 --> 00:17:58.600
Come out.

00:17:58.600 --> 00:17:59.360
Huh?

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:02.740
It must be tough being in there all the time, right?

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:09.510
Why did you say we were going out?

00:18:09.510 --> 00:18:13.370
It seemed like you didn't remember much about yourself.

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:17.600
So I made you my girlfriend.

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:22.540
Given the circumstances, I'll tell you everything.

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:26.400
You were being bullied, right?

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:30.430
I know who's behind it.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:33.540
It's Ikki's fans.

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:37.520
The garbage in the mailbox and the texts, too?

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:40.730
So you knew.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:44.220
I didn't want you to see them.

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:48.280
<i>Toma was trying to hide that from me.</i>

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:52.420
But as long as you feel attracted to Ikki,

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:54.910
the bullying won't end.

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.790
<i>I'm attracted to Ikki?</i>

00:18:58.510 --> 00:19:02.250
I'm only thinking about protecting you.

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:05.890
For that I'd do anything.

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:07.880
No matter what anyone thinks.

00:19:08.610 --> 00:19:12.160
In the extremest sense, no matter what you think of me,

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:15.370
I decided to protect you in my own way.

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:18.700
<i>Toma would go that far...</i>

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:23.450
What?

00:19:24.020 --> 00:19:25.360
Are you flirting with me?

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:26.990
Or pitying me?

00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:28.570
Stop it.

00:19:29.490 --> 00:19:31.930
I'll think that you're forgiving me.

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:35.720
I don't have the right to touch you,

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:38.190
or to tell you how I feel,

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:42.460
or to dream of happiness anymore.

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:46.410
<i>Why would you say that?</i>

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:47.430
Go back inside.

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:50.850
I'm feeling stricter again.

00:19:52.070 --> 00:19:53.460
I'm a man, too.

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:56.180
If you're in there, I can't get to you.

00:19:56.650 --> 00:20:00.720
You don't want to be assaulted by a man you don't like, do you?

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:07.750
Professor?

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:09.210
Yes.

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:13.000
The data is wrong?

00:20:13.590 --> 00:20:14.570
Okay.

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:15.480
I'm sorry.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:16.490
I'll be right there.

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:19.580
I'm going to the university for a bit.

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:21.870
I'll be back as soon as I can.

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:32.190
<i>Toma...</i>

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:36.480
<i>All this awful behavior isn't really him.</i>

00:20:37.640 --> 00:20:40.850
<i>Doing all this was really...</i>

00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:42.410
That's true.

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:46.190
What Toma's doing is strange...

00:20:46.520 --> 00:20:52.240
But it's all because his desire to protect you is too strong.

00:20:53.590 --> 00:20:55.450
I think so, too.

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:59.080
But if you and Toma aren't going out,

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:01.860
then how did you feel about him?

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:06.650
Maybe it's...

00:21:07.400 --> 00:21:08.500
In there...

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:11.340
Right. Now's our only chance.

00:21:19.050 --> 00:21:22.400
<i>It must be written in that diary.</i>

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:28.850
That was terrible!

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:31.820
You're bleeding.

00:21:32.360 --> 00:21:34.030
I'm almost there,

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:36.110
so I'll be okay.

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:45.260
<i>I might discover my true feelings.</i>

00:21:48.670 --> 00:21:49.520
<i>So...</i>

00:21:52.430 --> 00:21:53.650
<i>I have to find out.</i>

00:23:26.480 --> 00:23:29.790
Bear, cat, sheep, dog, rabbit, panda, and...

00:23:29.790 --> 00:23:32.580
Huh? Oh, those are the stuffed animals that were around you.

00:23:32.580 --> 00:23:36.680
Individually, they're cute, but when there're that many, it feels weird, doesn't it?

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:38.490
Like they might start talking at night...

00:23:38.490 --> 00:23:40.820
Sorry! I didn't mean to scare you!
